11. Provisions for prior medication:

    1. Systemic therapy (including chemotherapy, TKI inhibitors, and belintuzumab) 1 week or 5 half-lives prior to the cell collection period; clofarabine or cladribine within 3 months prior to enrollment, or pembrolizumab within 3 weeks prior to enrollment;
