    9. Live vaccination within 6 weeks prior to the start of screening. ii;
12. Prior or clinically significant CNS disorders at screening, such as epilepsy, epileptic seizures, paralysis, aphasia, stroke, severe brain injury, dementia, Parkinson's disease, cerebellar disorders, organic brain syndromes, or psychiatric disorders;
